<h2 id="overview">Overview</h2>
<p>Fireflies.ai is revolutionizing how teams handle meeting notes and follow-ups. This AI meeting assistant automatically joins your calls, records conversations, transcribes everything in real-time, and generates intelligent summaries with action items - all without you lifting a finger.</p>
<p>What makes Fireflies exceptional is its universal compatibility. Whether you're on Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, or even phone calls, Fireflies seamlessly integrates and captures everything. The AI doesn't just transcribe - it understands context, identifies speakers, extracts key topics, and even analyzes sentiment.</p>
<p>With over 300,000 teams relying on Fireflies daily, it's become the go-to solution for professionals who want to focus on conversations instead of frantically taking notes. The platform supports 69 languages and offers powerful search capabilities that let you find any discussion point across all your meetings in seconds.</p>
<h2 id="features">Key Features</h2>
<div class="features-grid">
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 1a3 3 0 0 0-3 3v8a3 3 0 0 0 6 0V4a3 3 0 0 0-3-3z"></path><path d="M19 10v2a7 7 0 0 1-14 0v-2"></path><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="19" y2="23"></line><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="23" y2="23"></line></svg></div>
<h4>Auto Transcription</h4>
<p>Automatically record and transcribe meetings across all platforms with 90%+ accuracy. Search transcripts instantly and jump to any moment.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><rect height="10" rx="2" width="18" x="3" y="11"></rect><circle cx="8" cy="15" r="1"></circle><circle cx="16" cy="15" r="1"></circle><path d="M9 7L9 9M15 7L15 9M12 2v5"></path></svg></div>
<h4>AI Meeting Summaries</h4>
<p>Get intelligent summaries highlighting key decisions, action items, and important discussions. Review hour-long meetings in minutes.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><line x1="18" x2="18" y1="20" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="20" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" x2="6" y1="20" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
<h4>Meeting Insights</h4>
<p>Analyze talk time, sentiment, engagement levels, and topics discussed. Perfect for sales calls, interviews, and team meetings.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10 13a5 5 0 0 0 7.54.54l3-3a5 5 0 0 0-7.07-7.07l-1.72 1.71"/><path d="M14 11a5 5 0 0 0-7.54-.54l-3 3a5 5 0 0 0 7.07 7.07l1.71-1.71"/></svg></div>
<h4>CRM Integration</h4>
<p>Auto-sync meeting notes to Salesforce, HubSpot, and other CRMs. Capture customer insights without manual data entry.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.35-4.35"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Smart Search</h4>
<p>Search across all meetings for specific topics, keywords, or action items. Find any discussion in your entire meeting history.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="neon-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg></div>
<h4>Collaboration Tools</h4>
<p>Share meeting clips, add comments, create soundbites, and collaborate with teammates on transcripts and notes.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon"><svg class="inline-icon" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
<h4>Automated Workflows</h4>
<p>Create custom workflows to automatically send summaries to Slack, create tasks in Asana, or update your CRM.</p>
</div>
<div class="feature-card">
<div class="feature-card-icon">🌍</div>
<h4>Multi-language Support</h4>
<p>Transcribe meetings in 69 languages with high accuracy. Perfect for global teams and international business.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h3>Conversation Intelligence</h3>
<p>Fireflies goes beyond basic transcription with conversation intelligence features. Track speaker talk time, analyze sentiment, identify frequently discussed topics, and measure meeting engagement. These insights are invaluable for sales teams analyzing customer calls and managers improving team communication.</p>
<h2 id="pros-cons">Pros &amp; Cons</h2>
<div class="pros-cons-grid">
<div class="pros-box">
<h4><svg class="inline-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Advantages</h4>
<ul>
<li>Works with all major platforms</li>
<li>Exceptional transcription accuracy</li>
<li>AI summaries save hours</li>
<li>Powerful search across meetings</li>
<li>Great CRM integrations</li>
<li>69 language support</li>
<li>Generous free tier</li>
<li>Easy to set up and use</li>
<li>Real-time transcription</li>
<li>Conversation analytics</li>
</ul>
</div>
