<h2 id="use-cases">Best Use Cases</h2>
<h3>Fireflies.ai Excels At:</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Sales Teams:</strong> Record customer calls, analyze objections, and sync insights to CRM automatically</li>
<li><strong>Remote Teams:</strong> Never miss meeting details, share notes instantly, keep everyone aligned</li>
<li><strong>Recruitment:</strong> Review candidate interviews, share feedback with team, maintain interview records</li>
<li><strong>Customer Success:</strong> Track customer concerns, identify trends, improve support quality</li>
<li><strong>Product Teams:</strong> Capture user feedback, document feature requests, analyze user needs</li>
<li><strong>Legal/Compliance:</strong> Create accurate meeting records with searchable transcripts</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="comparison">How It Compares</h2>
<h3>Fireflies.ai vs. Alternatives</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>vs. Otter.ai:</strong> Similar features but Fireflies has better CRM integration and conversation analytics.</li>
<li><strong>vs. Fathom:</strong> Fathom is free but limited to Zoom. Fireflies works everywhere with more features.</li>
<li><strong>vs. Grain:</strong> Grain focuses on sales calls, Fireflies is more versatile for all meeting types.</li>
<li><strong>vs. Built-in Zoom transcription:</strong> Fireflies offers AI summaries, search, analytics that Zoom lacks.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="verdict">Final Verdict</h2>
<div class="verdict-box">
<h3>Our Recommendation</h3>
<p>Fireflies.ai is an essential tool for any team that holds regular meetings. The ability to focus on conversations while AI handles all note-taking is transformative for productivity. The transcription accuracy is impressive, the AI summaries genuinely save time, and the search functionality makes past meetings actually useful. While there are occasional privacy concerns to consider, the benefits far outweigh the drawbacks for most teams. The free tier is generous enough for individuals and small teams, while the Pro plan at $10/month is a no-brainer for professionals who spend significant time in meetings. Highly recommended for sales teams, remote workers, and anyone who values their meeting time.</p>
</div>
<h2 id="faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">Does Fireflies work with all video conferencing platforms?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Yes! Fireflies works with Zoom, Google Meet, Microsoft Teams, Webex, RingCentral, and many others. It can even dial into phone conferences. The AI assistant joins automatically or on-demand based on your settings.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">How accurate is the transcription?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Fireflies achieves 90%+ accuracy for clear audio in English. Accuracy varies with audio quality, accents, and background noise. You can edit transcripts manually and add custom vocabulary to improve accuracy for industry-specific terms.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">Is Fireflies GDPR and SOC 2 compliant?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Yes, Fireflies is SOC 2 Type II certified and GDPR compliant. Enterprise plans offer additional security features including custom data retention policies and encryption. However, always inform meeting participants about recording.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">Can I use Fireflies for free?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Yes! The free plan includes 800 minutes of transcription per seat per month with unlimited storage. This is enough for most individuals. You can upgrade to Pro for more minutes and advanced AI features.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">Does Fireflies work in languages other than English?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Yes, Fireflies supports transcription in 69 languages including Spanish, French, German, Portuguese, Japanese, Chinese, and many more. Language selection is automatic or can be manually specified.</div>
</div>
<div class="faq-item">
<div class="faq-question">Can I integrate Fireflies with my CRM?<span>+</span></div>
<div class="faq-answer">Absolutely! Fireflies integrates with Salesforce, HubSpot, Pipedrive, and other major CRMs. It can automatically log call notes, update contacts, and sync action items. Available on Pro and higher plans.</div>
</div>
